    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just being sad... it's like the version of me that existed with him is just dead. im just a shell. everything feels so empty and pointless. i look around and i just don't see a future for myself. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i don't have to feel this emptiness anymore.",
