    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but you don't get it, it's not like i'm just \"learning\" to live. i feel like i'm hovering outside of my own life. we were one person, really. now that he's gone, that person doesn't exist anymore. it feels so wrong to be here and have him not be here. like i'm just a leftover part of a whole that's already finished.",
